class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"age\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Age</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">14</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"height\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Height</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">152 cm</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occup\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Potion merchant</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unconfirmed</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"firstintroduced\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Introduced In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lastseen\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ongoing</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Tirami</b> is an NPC appearing in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i>. She is <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a>'s rival and when talking, often uses stars in her text.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Character\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Character</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Normal\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Normal</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Challenge\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Challenge</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Dialogues\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogues</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Character\">Character</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/00/%ED%8B%B0%EB%9D%BC%EB%AF%B8.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150527215852\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Info on Tirami\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/00/%ED%8B%B0%EB%9D%BC%EB%AF%B8.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150527215852\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"티라미.jpg\" data-image-key=\"%ED%8B%B0%EB%9D%BC%EB%AF%B8.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:%ED%8B%B0%EB%9D%BC%EB%AF%B8.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Info on Tirami</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Tirami is a peppy and competitive potion merchant, who often visits <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a> issuing challenges to her to compete to see which one is the best. She gets along well with <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a>, despite her personality. If she fails her own quest, she will blush in embarrassment, but will brag if she does win.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests\">Quests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Normal\">Normal</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>She will giving normal quest, after fulfill the requirement, 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup#Sell_bonus\" title=\"Powerup\">sell bonus</a> will be given.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Challenge\">Challenge</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>She can issue a challenge quest. The challenge request will always involve telling the player to create a potion that sells for higher than a certain price. When the quest is complete, the current character gains 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Likeability\" title=\"Likeability\">likeability</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogues\">Dialogues</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Tirami/dialogues\" title=\"Tirami/dialogues\">Tirami's dialogues</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Tirami is the only character who can issue both normal quests and challenge quests.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<table id=\"Stub\" class=\"noprint stub plainlinks\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><i>This article is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Stub\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:Stub\">stub</a>. You can help Potion Maker Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Tirami?action=edit&amp;useeditor=source\">expanding it</a>.</i>\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"navtemplate\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#660099\" colspan=\"2\">Characters\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"65px\" style=\"background:#ddd\">Protagonists\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\">Tia</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"65px\" style=\"background:#ddd\"><a href=\"/wiki/Travelers\" title=\"Travelers\">Travelers</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tirami</strong> • <a href=\"/wiki/Neet\" title=\"Neet\">Neet</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Luke\" title=\"Luke\">Luke</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Claire\" title=\"Claire\">Claire</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Dolbur\" title=\"Dolbur\">Dolbur</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Piria\" title=\"Piria\">Piria</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Demian\" title=\"Demian\">Demian</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte\" title=\"Charlotte\">Charlotte</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Daisy\" title=\"Daisy\">Daisy</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Kyle\" title=\"Kyle\">Kyle</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261012222036\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 100/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 857/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,templat